    "publication_date": "2020-07-03",
    "description": "<p>This is the dataset that we used in&nbsp;the paper of &quot;Seismic Monitoring of Super High-Rise Building Using Ambient Noise with Dense Seismic Array&quot;. It includes two parts, one is 9-component IRFs for each floor with the virtual source station on the 2nd floor, the other is the&nbsp;hourly&nbsp;HVSR for&nbsp;the 75th floor.</p>",
